OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry start but cloud will soon
OL,6,Fthicken with outbreaks of rain
OL,7,Fspreading northeast, becoming heavy at
OL,8,Ftimes. Turning drier for a time in the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Southerly winds becoming
OL,10,Fstrong along the Solway coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMostly cloudy with showers or
OL,13,Flonger spells of rain, these heavy at
OL,14,Ftimes. Strong southerly winds with
OL,15,Fgales developing across Dumfries and
OL,16,FGalloway.
OL,17,
OL,18,CTuesday:FA mixture of bright spells
OL,19,Fand showers, some heavy. A windy day
OL,20,Ftoo with southwesterly gales.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
